lọ C Sủi giả</h2><span class="hidden text-bca-gray-400 text-xs font-medium">05/10/2026</span></figcaption></figure></article></a><a href="/bai-viet/khoi-to-bat-tam-giam-doi-voi-doan-van-sang-ve-toi-giet-nguoi-1764739308" class=""><article class="card-small h-full cursor-pointer group border-b border-b-bca-gray-100 pb-4"><figure class="h-full flex space-x-4 lg:space-x-[13px]"><picture class="relative block w-[103px] h-[68px] lg:h-[58px]" data-v-f505a7ed><source srcset="https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 1x, https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 640px)" type="image/webp" sizes="100vw" data-v-f505a7ed><source srcset="https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 1x, https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" sizes="100vw" data-v-f505a7ed><source srcset="https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 1x, https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp" sizes="100vw" data-v-f505a7ed><source srcset="https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 1x, https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-906b-cad1cffd861d-1635644772792535708.jpg 2x" media="(min-width: 1025px)" type="image/webp" sizes="100vw" data-v-f505a7ed><source srcset="https://bocongan.gov.vn/media/bca-media/small/library-20251203121643-9aef513b-17ef-4b57-9